    "0回" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0 left"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0回、広告を見て%lld回追加" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0 left. Watch an ad to add %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 回の挑戦は 10 球。10 球の合計飛距離を伸ばそう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each round is 10 pitches. Go for the longest total distance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 巡目はハートとスペードの Q を出せません（それしか無いときは出せます）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hearts and the queen of spades can't be played on the first trick (unless you have nothing else)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 枚引いて 1 枚切ります。切る牌はタップで選びます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draw a tile, then discard one. Tap the tile you want to discard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 枚引いて 1 枚切ります。同じ牌 3 枚か連番 3 枚を 4 組と、同じ牌 2 枚を 1 組そろえたら和了です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draw a tile, then discard one. Build 4 sets (3 of a kind or a 3-tile run) plus a pair to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 の役をぜんぶ埋めたら終わり。1〜6 の目の小計が 63 点以上ならボーナス +35 点です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when all 12 combos are filled. If Ones–Sixes total 63 or more, you get a +35 bonus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 の役をぜんぶ埋めたら終わり。合計点で自己ベストを目指そう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when all 12 combos are filled. Go for your best total."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "13 枚ずつ配られます。まず 3 枚を選んで、左どなりへ渡します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everyone gets 13 cards. First, choose 3 cards to pass to the player on your left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 個すべてが自陣（1〜6 ポイント）に入ったら、右端の置き場へ「あがり」。先に全部あげたほうの勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once all 15 checkers are in your home board (points 1-6), bear them off to the tray on the right. The first to bear off all of them wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15パズルの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play 15 Puzzle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1〜15 を左上から順に並べたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put 1-15 in order from the top left to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1〜15 を左上から順に並べたらクリアです。手数が少ないほど良い記録です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put 1-15 in order from the top left to win. Fewer moves is a better record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1〜6 の目の小計が 63 点以上なら、ボーナス +35 点。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Ones–Sixes total 63 or more, you get a +35 bonus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1回の挑戦は10球。画面の下のほうを押したままずらすと、水色のミートカーソルが指の動きだけ動きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each round is 10 pitches. Hold and slide near the bottom of the screen, and the light-blue contact cursor follows your finger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1手戻す" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Previous move"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1手進める" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Next move"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 つひと組の荷物が落ちてきます。よこにスワイプで動かし、タップで回し、下にスワイプで落とします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boxes fall in pairs. Swipe sideways to move them, tap to turn them, and swipe down to drop them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 つひと組の荷物を、スワイプとタップで動かします。画面のどこを触っても OK。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move each pair of boxes with swipes and taps. You can touch anywhere on the screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 枚めくってペアを探そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flip 2 cards to find a pair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2048 のタイルを作れたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make a 2048 tile to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2048 の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play 2048"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "21 に近づけたほうが勝ち" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Closest to 21 wins"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 が最弱で、2 とジョーカーが最強です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3 is the weakest card. 2 and the Joker are the strongest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "52 枚すべて最初から見えています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All 52 cards are face up from the start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8 を含む組を出すと場が流れ、そのまま続けて出せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playing a set with an 8 clears the table, and you get to play again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A は 1 か 11、J・Q・K は 10 点で数えます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An A counts as 1 or 11. J, Q and K count as 10."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU 3 人と東 1 局から東 4 局まで戦い、持ち点の多い順に順位が決まります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play against 3 CPUs from East 1 to East 4. Rankings go by points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU 3 人と東 1 局から南 4 局まで戦い、持ち点の多い順に順位が決まります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play East 1 through South 4 against 3 CPUs. Rankings go by points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU 3 人と東 1 局だけを戦い、持ち点の多い順に順位が決まります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play just East 1 against 3 CPUs. Rankings go by points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU が続けられなくなったら勝ち、あなたが続けられなくなったら負けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the CPU can't continue, you win; if you can't, you lose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU の強さは、右上の「新規対局」で選べます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose the CPU strength from \"New Game\" at the top right."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU の強さは右上の「新規対局」から 4 段階で選べます。強いほど顔に出にくく、置き場所をよく覚えます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose from 4 CPU levels with \"New Game\" at the top right. Stronger CPUs give less away and remember where you put the Joker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPUが続けられなくなればあなたの勝ち、あなたが続けられなくなれば負けです。自分が取った札がノルマ（かんたん4枚・ふつう6枚・むずかしい9枚）に届いた瞬間も勝ちで、届かないまま時間切れになると負けです。「とことん」はノルマが無く、札が尽きるまで続きます（取った場所には山札から新しい札が出ます）。全部の札を取りきればパーフェクトで勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the CPU can't continue, you win; if you can't, you lose. You also win the moment you reach the goal (Easy 4 cards, Normal 6, Hard 9), and lose if time runs out first. “Endless” has no goal and goes on until the cards run out (each card you take is replaced from the deck). Take every card for a Perfect win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPUの番" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU's turn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "±0枚" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "±0 chips"
          }
        }
      }
    },
