    "○のマスに置けるよ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can play on the ○ squares"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "♠♥♦♣ ごとに A から K まで組札に積み上げたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build each of ♠♥♦♣ from A to K on the foundations to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "♠♥♦♣ ごとに A から K まで組札に積み上げたらクリアです。52枚すべて最初から見えています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build each of ♠♥♦♣ from A to K on the foundations to win. All 52 cards are face up from the start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ". "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」で新しく始めます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starts a new game on %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を開いて新しく始めます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens %@ and starts a new game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ん」で終わる読みの札を選ぶと、その場で負けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a card whose reading ends in “n” and you lose on the spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ヒット」でもう 1 枚引き、「スタンド」でそこで止めます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Hit” to draw another card, “Stand” to stop there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「振る」でサイコロ 5 個を振ります。1 ターンに 3 回まで振れます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap Roll to roll 5 dice. You can roll up to 3 times per turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「振る」でサイコロ 5 個を振ります。残したい目はタップでキープし、1 ターンに 3 回まで振れます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap Roll to roll 5 dice. Tap dice to keep them; you can roll up to 3 times per turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそびば" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
