    "くわしいルール" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detailed Rules"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "こいこいのあとに相手にあがられると、相手の得点が 2 倍になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your opponent stops after you call Koi-Koi, their points are doubled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべての牌を消せたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear every tile to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そのほかの決まりは「くわしいルール」で見られます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "See “Detailed Rules” for the other rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "その他の操作" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "More actions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たて 9 マス・よこ 9 マス・太線で囲んだ 3×3 のどれにも、同じ数字は 1 つまでです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each row, column, and bold 3×3 box can hold each number only once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たての列・よこの行・太線の 3×3 のどれにも、同じ数字は 1 つまでです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each column, row, and bold 3×3 box can hold each number only once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たて・よこ・ななめのどれかで先に 4 つ並べたら勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Line up 4 first (down, across, or diagonally) to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たて・よこ・ななめのどれかで先に 5 つ並べたら勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Be the first to get 5 in a row: across, down, or diagonally."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "だれかが 50 点に届いたら終わり。合計の少ない人が勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when someone reaches 50 points. The lowest total wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ちがったらカードは伏せられ、CPU の番になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If they don't match, they're turned back over and it's the CPU's turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "つぎは「%@」にしてみる？" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try %@ next?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ときどき落ちてくるアイテムをパドルで受けると、パドルが伸びたり球が増えたりします。壊せるブロックを全部消すと次のステージへ。盤の球をすべて落とすと 1 ミスで、3 回で終わりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Catch the items that sometimes fall to get a longer paddle or extra balls. Break every breakable block to reach the next stage. Losing all your balls costs a life, and the game ends after 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "とばし・ぎゃく・+2・いろがえ・いろがえ+4 の特殊札で流れを変えましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn the game around with the special cards: Skip, Reverse, +2, Color Change, and Color Change +4."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらかの側の穴が空になったら終わり。ストアの種が多いほうの勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when one side's pits are empty. Whoever has more seeds in their store wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらも出せなくなったら「めくる」で、両方の山札から1枚ずつ台札に置きます。CPU の速さは右上の「＋」で始めるときに選べます。あなたの側に制限時間はありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When neither side can play, tap “Flip” to put one card from each stock onto the piles. Choose the CPU's pace when you start a game with “+” at the top right. There's no time limit on your side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめから" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restart"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぱっと暗算の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Quick Mental Math"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぶつかるか穴に落ちたらおしまい。途中で閉じると記録は残りません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crash or fall into a hole and the run is over. If you close the game midway, the run isn't recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぶつかるか穴に落ちたらミス。何度でもステージの頭からやり直せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crash or fall into a hole and it's a wipeout. You can restart the stage as many times as you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぶつかるか穴に落ちたらミス。何度でもステージの頭からやり直せます。青いチェックポイントより先で失敗した場合は、広告を見てそこから再開することもできます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crash or fall into a hole and it's a wipeout. You can restart the stage as many times as you like. If you fail past a blue checkpoint, you can watch an ad to restart from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの駒の動きや特別ルールは「くわしいルール」で見られます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "See “Detailed Rules” for the other pieces and special moves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まとめて動かせるのは、同じスートで降順に揃った並びだけです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only same-suit runs in descending order move together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まとめて動かせるのは、同じスートで降順に揃った並びだけです。動かせる手が無くなったら左上の山札をタップして各列に1枚ずつ配ります（空いた列があると配れません）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only same-suit runs in descending order move together. When you're out of moves, tap the stock at the top left to deal one card to each column (not while a column is empty)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一回" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
