    },
    "カードしりとりの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Card Shiritori"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カードの合計を 21 に近づけたほうが勝ち。21 を超えると負けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get your total closer to 21 than the dealer. Go over 21 and you lose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カードを 2 枚めくり、同じ絵柄ならペアを取れて、もう一度めくれます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flip 2 cards. If they match, you take the pair and flip again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カードを 2 枚めくります。同じ絵柄ならペアになり、もう一度めくれます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
