      }
    },
    "入院か、荷物が出てくる位置（▼の列のいちばん上）が埋まったら終わりです。どちらも記録は残ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends if he's hospitalized or the spot where boxes appear (the top of the ▼ column) fills up. Your record is saved either way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部の数字をつなぎ、全マスを線で埋めたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect every number and fill every square with lines to clear the puzzle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "円盤は 3〜7 枚から選べます。最少手数は 3 枚で 7 手、1 枚増えるごとに約 2 倍です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose from 3 to 7 disks. The fewest moves is 7 with 3 disks, and about doubles with each extra disk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "円盤を全部、右の柱へ移したらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move all the disks to the right peg to clear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出した札のぶん、山札から手札に補充されます。手札も山札も先に出し切ったほうの勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hand refills from your stock as you play. The first to play out both their hand and stock wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せない・出したくないときはパス。全員パスすると場が流れます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you can't or don't want to play, pass. When everyone passes, the table is cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せる札がなければ山から 1 枚引きます。引いた札が出せるなら、そのまま出せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you can't play, draw a card. If the card you drew can be played, you can play it right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出た数を、頭の中でぜんぶ足していきましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
