          }
        }
      }
    },
    "制限時間は 60 秒。しりとりが成立すると +10 秒、成立しない札を選ぶと -5 秒。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You have 60 seconds. A good link adds 10 seconds; a card that doesn't link takes 5 away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "制限時間は60秒。しりとりが成立するたびに+10秒、成立しない札を選ぶと-5秒。「ん」で終わる読みを選ぶとその場で負けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You have 60 seconds. Each good link adds 10 seconds, and a card that doesn't link takes 5 seconds away. Pick a reading that ends in “n” and you lose on the spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かすたびに、空いたマスに新しいタイルが 1 枚出ます。どこにも動かせなくなったら終わりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each move adds a new tile to an empty square. The game ends when no tile can move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列か、左上のフリーセル、右上の組札をタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap a column, a free cell (top left), or a foundation (top right)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列かフリーセル、組札をタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
