      }
    },
    "動かせる手が無くなったら左上の山札をタップ。各列に 1 枚ずつ配ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Out of moves? Tap the stock at the top left to deal one card to each column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "半透明の○が置けるマスです。タップして石を置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Faint ○ marks show where you can play. Tap one to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取った札がノルマの枚数に届いたら勝ち。届かないまま時間切れになると負けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Win when the cards you've taken reach the goal. If time runs out first, you lose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取った札が新しい場の札になり、CPU の番になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The card you take becomes the new card in play, and it's the CPU's turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取った札のハートは 1 枚 1 点、スペードの Q は 13 点。点は少ないほど良い。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each heart you take is 1 point and the queen of spades is 13. Fewer points is better."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取れるのは、上に牌が乗っておらず、左右どちらかが空いている牌だけです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can only take a tile with nothing on top and an open left or right side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1つ違いの札を台札のほうへ払おう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flick a card one up or down toward a pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札は真ん中の2山。台札の数字と1つ違い（A と K もつながる）の手札を、重ねたい台札のほうへ払って出します。順番はなく、CPU も同時に出してきます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The two piles in the middle are the play piles. Flick a card that's one higher or lower than a pile (A and K connect) toward that pile to play it. There are no turns: the CPU plays at the same time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右上の「難易度」で、桁数・個数・速さをそれぞれ選べます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use “Difficulty” at the top right to set the digits, how many numbers, and the speed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右上の「難易度」で桁数・個数・速さをそれぞれ選べます。まずは 1 桁・5 個から。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use “Difficulty” at the top right to set the digits, how many numbers, and the speed. Start with 1 digit and 5 numbers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合計飛距離を伸ばそう。挑戦は1日3回で、打席に立った時点で1回減ります（0:00 に戻ります）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go for the longest total distance. You get 3 rounds a day; one is used as soon as you step up to bat (they reset at 0:00)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じスートが無いときは、どの札でも出せます。点の札を押し付けるチャンス。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you can't follow suit, you can play any card. A chance to dump point cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じスートで K から A まで 13 枚揃うと自動で取り除かれ、8 組取り除いたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A full same-suit run from K to A (13 cards) is removed automatically. Remove 8 to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じスートで K から A まで13枚揃うと自動で取り除かれます。8組すべて取り除いたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A full same-suit run from K to A (13 cards) is removed automatically. Remove all 8 to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字どうしがぶつかると合体して 2 倍になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When two tiles with the same number collide, they merge into one with double the value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字の 2 枚（ペア）は捨てます。配られた手札のペアは最初に捨ててから始めます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Two cards of the same number make a pair and are discarded. Pairs in your dealt hand are discarded before play starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字の点どうしを、指でなぞって線でつなぎます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace with your finger to connect each pair of matching numbers with a line."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字の点を、なぞってつなごう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace to connect matching numbers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字を 4 枚以上まとめて出すと革命。カードの強さが逆になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playing 4 or more of the same number at once starts a Revolution, which flips the card ranking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ月を合わせる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match cards of the same month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ条件でもう一回" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play Again, Same Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ盆栽どうしが触れるとくっついて、1 つ立派な盆栽になります。いちばん立派なのは金の松です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When two of the same bonsai touch, they merge into the next, grander bonsai. The grandest is the Golden Pine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌 3 枚か連番 3 枚を 4 組と、同じ牌 2 枚を 1 組そろえたら和了です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build 4 sets (3 of a kind or a 3-tile run) plus a pair to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌を 2 枚タップで消そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap 2 matching tiles to clear them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ絵柄の牌を 2 枚タップすると消えます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap 2 matching tiles to remove them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ色か同じ数字の札を出そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play the same color or number"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ荷物がたて・よこに 4 つ以上つながると消えます。消えたあとに落ちてきた荷物がまたつながれば、れんさです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect 4 or more of the same box up, down, or sideways to clear them. If the boxes that fall after a clear connect again, that's a chain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ荷物がたて・よこに 4 つ以上つながると消えます。落ちてきてまたつながれば「れんさ」。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect 4 or more of the same box up, down, or sideways to clear them. If falling boxes connect again, it's a “chain”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和了の形でも役が無いと上がれません。聴牌したら立直を宣言すると役が付きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A winning shape still needs at least one yaku to win. Declare Riichi when you're in Tenpai to get one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "四目並べの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Yonmoku Narabe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回数が 0 のときは、広告を見て 1 回遊べます（1 日の本数に上限があります）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you're out of rounds, you can watch an ad to play once (there's a daily limit)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "囲碁の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Go"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地雷がありそうなマスは、長押しで旗を立てられます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press and hold a square you think hides a mine to plant a flag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地雷がありそうなマスは長押しで旗を立てられます（旗のマスは開きません）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press and hold a square you think hides a mine to plant a flag (flagged squares won't open)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地雷以外のマスをすべて開けたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open every square without a mine to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場に出ている組より強い組を出します。手札を先になくした人が勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play a stronger set than the one on the table. The first to empty their hand wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場の札と同じ色か、同じ数字・記号の札を出します。手札を先になくした人が勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play a card that matches the top card's color, number, or symbol. The first to empty their hand wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場の札の読みの最後の字から始まる札を選んで取ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take a card whose reading starts with the last kana of the card in play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場の札の読みの最後の字から始まる読みの札を選んで取ります。取った札が新しい場の札になり、CPUの番です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take a card whose reading starts with the last sound of the current card's reading. The card you take becomes the new current card, and it's the CPU's turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場より強い組を出そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play a set stronger than the table"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札は 1 つ小さくて色ちがいの札だけ重ねられます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the tableau, you can only stack a card one lower in the other color."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札は 1 つ小さくて色ちがいの札だけ重ねられます。空いた列にはどの札でも置けます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the tableau, you can only stack a card one lower in the other color. Any card can go in an empty column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札は1つ小さくて色ちがいの札だけ重ねられます（黒の8 の上に 赤の7）。空いた列には K だけ置けます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the tableau, you can only stack a card one lower in the other color (a red 7 on a black 8). Only a K can go in an empty column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札は1つ小さくて色ちがいの札だけ重ねられます（黒の8 の上に 赤の7）。空いた列にはどの札でも置けます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the tableau, you can only stack a card one lower in the other color (a red 7 on a black 8). Any card can go in an empty column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "壊せるブロックを全部消すと次のステージへ進みます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Break every breakable block to reach the next stage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "多くペアを取ったほうが勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever takes more pairs wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大きい円盤は、小さい円盤の上には置けません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A larger disk can't be placed on top of a smaller one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大富豪の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Daifugo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "対局開始" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start Game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将棋の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Shogi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "山札をタップすると、選んだ枚数（1 枚か 3 枚）をめくれます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the stock to draw the number of cards you chose (1 or 3)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左の柱の円盤を全部、右の柱へ移したらクリア。最少手数は 3 枚で 7 手、1 枚増えるごとに約 2 倍です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move every disk from the left peg to the right peg to clear. The fewest moves is 7 with 3 disks, and about doubles with each extra disk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左右に動かして、離すと落ちる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slide to aim, let go to drop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を最後まで視聴しなかったか、広告を読み込めませんでした。\n通信状態をご確認のうえ、もう一度お試しください。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ad wasn't watched to the end, or it couldn't be loaded.\nCheck your connection and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て +%lld" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ad +%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに局面が変わったため、ヒントを出せませんでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The position changed while the ad was playing, so no hint could be given."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに新しい対局が始まったか、局面が変わったため、戻せませんでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new game started or the position changed while the ad was playing, so your move couldn't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て戻す" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an Ad to Undo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を視聴すると、最善手をもう1手示します。使った対局は順位表に送りません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to see one more best move. Games where you use a hint aren't sent to the leaderboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "引いたジョーカーは手札の右端に入り、CPU に場所を見られます。「シャッフル」で並びを混ぜましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Joker you draw goes to the right end of your hand, and the CPUs see where it is. Tap \"Shuffle\" to mix your hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "引き分け" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draw"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "引く札を選んで、CPU の顔をよく見よう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a card and watch the CPU's face"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "役ができたら「あがり」で得点、「こいこい」で続けて役を伸ばせます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you make a yaku, “Stop” to score, or call “Koi-Koi” to keep going for more."
          }
        }
