      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a die to keep it. Kept dice are not rerolled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残したい目をタップでキープ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap dice to keep them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "入れ替えるカードをタップしよう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the cards to swap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "毎回ちがうコースを、ミスするまで走ります。走った距離が記録です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ride a new course every time until you wipe out. Your distance is your record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "決め手 %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Winning move: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "無料の待ったは使い切りました。\n広告を視聴すると、もう一度あなたの直前の1手（CPU の応手ごと）を取り消せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've used your free undo.\nWatch an ad to take back your last move again (along with the CPU's reply)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片側の穴がすべて空になったら終わり。ストアの種が多いほうの勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when all pits on one side are empty. More seeds in your store wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "王手が無いのに動けないときは引き分けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If a player isn't in check but has no legal move, the game is a draw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現在の対局を終了します。CPUの勝ちになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This ends the current game. The CPU wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "球をはね返してブロックに当てます。灰色のブロックは壊れません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bounce the ball into the blocks. Gray blocks can't be broken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面の下のほうを押したままずらすと、水色のミートカーソルが指の動きだけ動きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold and slide near the bottom of the screen, and the light-blue contact cursor follows your finger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面をタップするとおじさんが走り出し、あとは自動で右へ進みます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the screen and Ojisan starts riding. He keeps going right on his own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面をタップするとおじさんが走り出します。あとは自動で右へ進みます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the screen and Ojisan starts riding. He keeps going right on his own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤の下で指を横に動かしてパドルを操作" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slide below the board to move the paddle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤の大きさは 5×5 と 7×7 から選べます。どの問題も答えは 1 つです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a 5×5 or 7×7 board. Every puzzle has exactly one solution."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤の球をすべて落とすと 1 ミス。3 回ミスで終わりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Losing all your balls costs a life. The game ends after 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤の端や角では、盤の中にある隣だけが入れ替わります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On edges and corners, only the neighbors inside the board flip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤を見る" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "View Board"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤ゲーム" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Board Games"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤面のかたちは 3 種類。どれも必ず取り切れるように配ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 3 layouts. Every one is dealt so it can always be cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手が 3 つ並べたら、4 つ目の場所を先にふさぎましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When your opponent has 3 in a row, block the fourth spot first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手が 4 つ並べたら、次の一手で止めましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When your opponent has 4 in a row, block it on your next move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手のキングに王手をかけ、逃げ場をなくしたら勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put the enemy King in check with no way out to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手のキングに王手をかけ、逃げ場をなくしたら勝ちです（王手が無いのに動けないときは引き分け）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put the enemy King in check with no way out to win (if a player isn't in check but has no legal move, it's a draw)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の王将（王）を追いつめたら勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trap your opponent's King to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の石をぐるりと囲むと取り上げられます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Surround enemy stones completely to capture them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の駒が 2 個以上あるポイントには止まれません。1 個だけなら叩いてバー（中央）へ送れます。バーの駒は先に戻さないと他の駒を動かせません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can't land on a point with 2 or more enemy checkers. If there's just one, you can hit it and send it to the bar (in the middle). Checkers on the bar must come back in before any others can move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の駒があるマスへ動くと、その駒を取れます。取った駒は持ち駒になり、あとで好きなマスに打てます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move onto an enemy piece to capture it. Captured pieces become yours, and you can drop them on any open square later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手陣（奥から 3 段）に入ると駒を成れて、動きが強くなります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a piece enters the enemy camp (the far 3 rows), it can promote and get stronger moves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "神経衰弱の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Memory Match"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "種は反時計回りにまき、相手のストアは飛ばします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seeds go counterclockwise, skipping the opponent's store."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空いた列があると、山札は配れません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can't deal from the stock while a column is empty."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空いた列には K だけ置けます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only a K can go in an empty column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空いているマスをすべて埋めたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fill every empty square to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空いているマスをタップして、黒と白が交互に石を置きます。" : {
