        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap an empty spot to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空中でもう一度タップすると、二段ジャンプできます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap again in midair for a double jump."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空白と同じ列・行にあるタイルをタップすると、間のタイルをまとめて動かせます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a tile in the same row or column as the gap to slide all the tiles in between at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空白と同じ列・行のタイルをタップすると、間のタイルをまとめて動かせます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a tile in the same row or column as the gap to slide all the tiles in between at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空白の隣にあるタイルをタップすると、空白へスライドします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a tile next to the gap to slide it in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空白の隣をタップで動く" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap next to the gap to slide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "立直できるのは鳴いていない手だけで、1000 点を供託します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only a closed hand (no calls) can declare Riichi, and it puts up 1000 points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指を左右に動かすと、縁側のおじさんが盆栽を持って付いてきます。離すとその真下の庭へ落とします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slide your finger left or right and Ojisan follows along the veranda with the bonsai. Let go to drop it into the garden below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "終わったとき穴に残った種は、その側のストアに入ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the end, seeds left in the pits go to that side's store."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "終了して%@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quit & %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "結果を閉じて盤面を見返します" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Closes the result so you can look back over the board"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "続けて山札が 1 枚めくれます。こちらも同じ月の札と合わさります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Then a card is flipped from the deck. It also captures a card of the same month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "続けて山札が1枚めくれます。こちらも同じ月の札と合わさります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Then a card is flipped from the deck. It also captures a card of the same month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線つなぎの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Connect Pairs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線の交わるところをタップして、交互に石を置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take turns tapping where the lines cross to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線の交わるところをタップして、黒と白が交互に石を置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black and White take turns tapping where the lines cross to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線の途中から触ると、そこから引き直せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Touch the middle of a line to redraw it from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線は交差できません。別の線に触れると、その線はそこで切れます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lines can't cross. Touching another line cuts that line at that point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "縮む輪が白い的に重なった瞬間に指を離すと、スイングします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Let go the moment the shrinking ring overlaps the white target to swing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "縮む輪が白い的に重なった瞬間に指を離すとスイング。カーソルをボールの少し下に置くと打球が上がり、左右と離す早さで方向が決まります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Let go the moment the shrinking ring overlaps the white target to swing. Put the cursor just under the ball to lift it; where you aim and when you let go set the direction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "置けるのは、ひとつ上の札より 1 つ小さい札（スートは問いません）か、空いた列です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A card can go on one that's one higher (any suit), or in an empty column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "腰痛ゲージがあり、重い荷物をかかえるほど腰にきて、満タンになると入院です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Back Pain gauge fills as he carries heavy boxes. When it's full, he goes to the hospital."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分の番では、次の CPU の伏せた札を 1 枚選んで引きます。ペアができたら捨て、手札がなくなったら抜けられます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On your turn, pick one face-down card from the next CPU and draw it. Discard any pair you make; once your hand is empty, you're out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分の番では、次の CPU の伏せた札を 1 枚選んで引きます。ペアができたら捨てます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On your turn, pick one face-down card from the next CPU and draw it. If it makes a pair, discard it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分の石ではさんだ相手の石は、すべて自分の色に裏返ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every enemy stone trapped between your stones flips to your color."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分の駒をタップすると、動けるマスが光ります。行きたいマスをタップで移動します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap one of your pieces to light up the squares it can move to. Tap a square to move there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自己ベスト更新。%@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New personal best. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自己ベスト更新！" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New Personal Best!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花札こいこいの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Hanafuda Koi-Koi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花牌どうし・季節牌どうしは、絵柄がちがってもペアになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any two flower tiles make a pair, and so do any two season tiles, even if the pictures differ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物が出てくる位置（▼の列のいちばん上）が埋まったら終わりです。記録は得点として残ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when the spot where boxes appear (the top of the ▼ column) fills up. Your score is saved as your record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物は 5 種類。重いものほど腰にきます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 5 kinds of boxes. The heavier they are, the more they hurt his back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物は 5 種類あります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 5 kinds of boxes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物を 4 つそろえて消して、ラインより下まで片付けたらクリア。腰をいたわろう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match 4 boxes to clear them, and clear everything below the line to win. Go easy on his back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物を 4 つそろえて消して、得点をのばそう。空の盤から始まり、埋まるまで続きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match 4 boxes to clear them and rack up points. You start with an empty board and play until it fills up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物を置くほど少しずつ速くなります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boxes fall a little faster the more you place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷運びモードはラインより下まで片付けたらクリア。重い荷物をかかえるほど腰にきて、満タンで入院です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Moving Mode, clear everything below the line to win. Heavy boxes strain Ojisan's back, and a full gauge sends him to the hospital."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "落ちてくるアイテムをパドルで受けると、パドルが伸びたり球が増えたりします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Catch falling items to get a longer paddle or extra balls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "記録をシェア" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share record"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定を変える" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Change Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読み中…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thinking…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "途中の盤面は保存されません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A game in progress isn't saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選んだカードを引き直せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The cards you picked are replaced with new ones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配られた 13 枚から 3 枚を左どなりへ渡し、クラブの 2 から順に 1 枚ずつ出します。出された札と同じスートがあれば必ず出します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pass 3 of your 13 cards to the left, then play one card each in turn, starting with the 2 of clubs. You must follow the suit that was led if you can."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配られた手札から同じ数字の 2 枚（ペア）を捨てて始めます。ジョーカーはペアになりません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start by discarding every two cards of the same number (a pair) from your hand. The Joker never makes a pair."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長押しで旗を立てられる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press and hold to plant a flag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "閉じる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "難易度は 3 段階で、最短の手数（4・7・10 手）が変わります。少ない手数ほど良い記録です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 3 difficulties with different fewest possible moves (4, 7 and 10). Fewer moves make a better record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "青いチェックポイントより先でミスしたときは、広告を見てそこから再開することもできます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you wipe out past a blue checkpoint, you can watch an ad to restart from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "駒ごとに動き方が違います。ナイトは L 字、ビショップはななめ、ルークはたてよこです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each piece moves differently. The Knight jumps in an L, the Bishop moves diagonally, and the Rook moves straight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "駒ごとに動き方が違います（ナイトは L 字、ビショップはななめ…）。「くわしいルール」で確認できます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each piece moves differently (the Knight in an L, the Bishop diagonally…). See “Detailed Rules” for all of them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "駒ごとの動き方は、盤の駒をタップすると光るマスで確かめられます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To see how a piece moves, tap it on the board and check the squares that light up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "駒をタップ → 移動先をタップ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a piece → tap where to go"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麻雀の遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Mahjong"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麻雀ソリティアの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Mahjong Solitaire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麻雀・花札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mahjong & Hanafuda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒が先手です。盤が全部埋まったら引き分けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black moves first. If the board fills up, it's a draw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒は三三・四四・長連が打てない" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black can't play double three, double four, or overline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒（先手）だけは禁じ手があり、三三・四四・長連（6 つ以上）になる場所には打てません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only Black (who moves first) has forbidden moves: no double three, double four, or overline (6 or more in a row)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指を左右に動かすと、縁側のおじさんが盆栽を持って付いてきます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slide your finger left and right, and Ojisan on the veranda follows, holding a bonsai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指を離すと、その真下の庭へ盆栽が落ちます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lift your finger and the bonsai drops into the garden right below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ盆栽どうしが触れるとくっついて、1 つ立派な盆栽になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When two matching bonsai touch, they merge into one grander bonsai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盆栽は 11 種類。いちばん立派なのは金の松です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 11 kinds of bonsai. The grandest is the Golden Pine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上の点線より上に盆栽がとどまると、ゲームオーバーです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If a bonsai stays above the dotted line at the top, the game is over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "立派に育てるほど高得点です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The grander they grow, the higher your score."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場の札と同じ色か、同じ数字・記号の札を出せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can play a card of the same color, or the same number or symbol, as the top card of the pile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せる札がなければ、山から 1 枚引きます。引いた札が出せるなら、そのまま出せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you have no card to play, draw one from the deck. If the drawn card can be played, you can play it right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "とばしは次の人の番を飛ばし、ぎゃくは回る向きを逆にします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skip skips the next player's turn, and Reverse flips the direction of play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "+2 は、次の人が 2 枚引いて番を飛ばされます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With +2, the next player draws 2 cards and loses their turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いろがえはどの札の上にも出せて、次の色を選べます。いろがえ+4 は次の人が 4 枚引きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Color Change can go on any card and lets you pick the next color. With Color Change +4, the next player draws 4 cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手札を先になくした人が勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first player to get rid of all their cards wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたは白。サイコロの目のぶん、駒を右下の自陣へ向けて進めます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You play White. Move your checkers by the numbers rolled, toward your home board at the bottom right."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす駒 → 行き先の順にタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the checker to move, then where it goes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の駒が 2 個以上あるポイントには止まれません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can't land on a point with 2 or more opposing checkers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の駒が 1 個だけなら、叩いてバー（中央）へ送れます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If there's only 1 opposing checker, you can hit it and send it to the bar (center)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 個すべてが自陣（1〜6 ポイント）に入ったら、右端の置き場へ「あがり」。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once all 15 checkers are in your home board (points 1-6), bear them off to the tray on the right."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バーに自分の駒があるときは、先にその駒を盤へ戻さないと、他の駒を動かせません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While you have a checker on the bar, you must bring it back onto the board before moving any other checker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先に 15 個すべてをあげたほうの勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first to bear off all 15 checkers wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札は真ん中の 2 山。数字が 1 つ違いの札を、どちらかの台札に重ねます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The two piles in the middle are the target piles. Play a card whose number is one higher or lower onto either pile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A と K もつながります。マークは関係ありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A and K connect, too. Suits don't matter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "順番はなく、CPU も同時に出してきます。出したぶん、山札から手札に補充されます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are no turns — the CPU plays at the same time. Cards you play are replaced from your stock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらも出せなくなったら「めくる」。両方の山札から 1 枚ずつ台札に置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When neither side can play, tap “Flip” to put one card from each stock onto the piles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手札も山札も先に出し切ったほうの勝ち。山札が無くなったら、めくらずに手札を出し切れば勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first to play out both hand and stock wins. Once your stock runs out, you no longer flip: play out your hand to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU の速さは、右上の「＋」で始めるときに選べます。あなたの側に制限時間はありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose the CPU's pace when you start a game with “+” at the top right. There's no time limit on your side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ディーラーと 10 回勝負します。勝てば 1 点、最初の 2 枚の 21（ブラックジャック）で勝てば 2 点。10 回の合計が自己ベストになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play 10 rounds against the dealer. A win scores 1 point, and winning with 21 on your first two cards (a blackjack) scores 2. Your 10-round total counts toward your personal best."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ヒット」でもう 1 枚引き、「スタンド」でそこで止めます。最初の 2 枚が同じ点数（10・J・Q・K は同じ 10 点）なら、2 手に分ける「スプリット」も選べます。分けた手はそれぞれ勝てば 1 点です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap Hit to draw another card, or Stand to stop. If your first two cards have the same value (10, J, Q and K all count as 10), you can Split them into two hands. Each split hand scores 1 point if it wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ディーラーと 10 回勝負。勝てば 1 点、ブラックジャックで勝てば 2 点で、10 回の合計が自己ベストになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10 rounds against the dealer. A win scores 1 point, a blackjack win scores 2, and your 10-round total counts toward your personal best."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10・J・Q・K は同じ 10 点なので、スプリットできます。分けた手はそれぞれ勝てば 1 点です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10, J, Q and K all count as 10, so you can split them. Each split hand scores 1 point if it wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "負けた回は、広告を見て 1 回だけやり直せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once per match, you can watch an ad to replay a round you lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10 回勝負。勝った回は自分の役の点が入ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play 10 rounds. Each round you win scores the points of your hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU と手札を見せ合い、役の強い側がその回の勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show hands with the CPU. The stronger hand wins the round."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10 回勝負。勝った回は自分の役の点が入り、合計点の多い側が勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play 10 rounds. Each round you win scores the points of your hand, and the higher total wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "役の一覧は「くわしいルール」、点数は「役の点数表」で見られます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "See “Detailed Rules” for the list of hands, and the “Hand Points” table for their points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ると、10 回のうち 1 度だけもう 1 回カードを交換できます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to draw cards one more time, once per 10 rounds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "マスをタップすると ×（いない）を付け外しし、ダブルタップでそのマスの猫を見つけます。全部の猫を見つけたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a square to add or remove × (no cat). Double-tap a square to find the cat there. Find every cat to clear the puzzle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "タップで ×（いない）を付け外し、ダブルタップで猫を見つけます。全部見つけたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap to add or remove × (no cat), double-tap to find a cat. Find them all to clear the puzzle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "× の付け外しはミスになりません。答えでないマスをダブルタップすると、赤い × が付いてミスになります（赤い × は消せません）。ミスが 3 回になると終わりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adding or removing × never counts as a miss. Double-tapping a square that isn't part of the answer puts a red × there and counts as a miss (the red × can't be removed). Three misses end the game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
